<p>Remember, remember, the 8th of September! If you don't, it'll turn you into lemons.</p>
<p>Many hours, many thousands of pruned words, and probably a few tears went into this one. Oh, and two weeks of my life, on and off, but who's counting?</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flopmind" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6407594); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6407594&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603161310" alt="Flopmind" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6407594)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flopmind" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6407594); return false;">Flopmind</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/caspian2" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5343993); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5343993&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603161310" alt="caspian2" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5343993)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/caspian2" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5343993); return false;">caspian2</a></span> for their critiques! Boos to me if I didn't learn enough from them.</p>
